### Description

Create a new job plan under a resource scope, based on a job template. Validation, permission checks, and persistence align with the web UI create-plan flow; this endpoint only exposes the OpenAPI V4 contract (JSON body, snake_case field names).

### Scope (product confirmed)

**Only supports creating a plan under an existing job template**: an existing, accessible `job_template_id` is required. Scenarios such as no template, draft-only, or a standalone JSON description of all steps are **not** supported. Any future extension needs a separate spec and API.

### Request Parameters

#### Body Parameters

| Field            | Type   | Required | Description |
|------------------|--------|----------|-------------|
| bk_scope_type    | string | Yes      | Resource scope type. Allowed values: `biz` (business) or `biz_set` (business set) |
| bk_scope_id      | string | Yes      | Resource scope ID (business ID or business set ID) |
| job_template_id  | long   | Yes      | Job template ID; must exist and the caller must be allowed to create a plan for it |
| name             | string | Yes      | Plan name; same rules as web: trim, non-empty, no illegal characters, max length 60 |
| enable_steps     | array  | Yes      | List of template step IDs to enable (template step id / templateStepId in model), same as web “enabled steps” |
| variables        | array  | No       | Optional overrides for global variable default values; same semantics as web `TaskPlanCreateUpdateReq.variables`. Omit or pass `[]` to use template definitions only |

**`variables` item fields** (aligned with web plan variable VO; request uses snake_case):

| Field                 | Type   | Required | Description |
|-----------------------|--------|----------|-------------|
| id                    | long   | Conditional | Template global variable ID when overriding defaults |
| name                  | string | Conditional | Variable name |
| type                  | int    | Conditional | Variable type 1-6, same as product documentation |
| default_value         | string | No       | Default for non host-list types |
| default_target_value  | object | No       | For host list type; same structure as `TaskTargetVO` in web |
| value                 | string | No       | Value field, same as web |
| target_value          | object | No       | Host list value |
| description           | string | No       | Description |
| changeable            | int    | Conditional | 0 = fixed, 1 = changeable |
| required              | int    | Conditional | 0 = optional, 1 = required |
| delete                | int    | No       | 0/1, rarely used on create |

### Request Example

- POST

```json
{
    "bk_scope_type": "biz",
    "bk_scope_id": "2",
    "job_template_id": 1000,
    "name": "my-api-plan",
    "enable_steps": [1, 2, 3],
    "variables": []
}
```

